ot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"14c4218f6948c143700beab71c7e4acf7f2a18b70e896ed0448c9f5eef564e7e","event_uuid":"888432e3-fc32-4a3e-9b71-d9d68f1597d3","position":{"commit_sha":"e5a99747e2b3558df3c8d553d8921dcaeeb1c778","position":"1786138783028501001-888432e3-fc32-4a3e-9b71-d9d68f1597d3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"eac05c3cff374a32fdc37d7014a8e88af9089d05fe94aa3d46b28346f5899b2f","event_uuid":"1b9cb66f-2f97-4a26-bdbd-dcc14c82db56","position":{"commit_sha":"e5a99747e2b3558df3c8d553d8921dcaeeb1c778","position":"1786138783632369001-1b9cb66f-2f97-4a26-bdbd-dcc14c82db56"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786046891127168001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"134d1a41-20f9-481c-a449-1c828dc48af7","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"ae96-f114-5363-4d57"},{"link_uuid":"046773b0-7972-4eb6-a67e-92c9cd2bfe05","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"47e9-728e-ba93-485e"},{"link_uuid":"066764f1-51b2-4296-8eb0-2c5c758b6e95","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"fcc0-3a8c-e88c-46d8"}],"description":"`docs/exit-codes.md` declares itself \"the single source of truth\" (`:5`) covering \"each public\ndispatcher arm\" (`:69`). It has 41 table rows against 75 real commands — independently re-derived\nfrom `_cli/_help.known_subcommands()` union `_cli/__init__._INTERCEPTS`. The 34 omissions include\n`review-plan`, `review-code`, and `verify-completion`, whose exit-11 semantics the same document\ndefines four lines into its own codes table.\n\nGrounding found worse: codes **75** (`RebaseGuard`/`EXIT_RESCHEDULE`) and **78**\n(`StoreIncompatibleError`) reach the process exit status via `_seam.py:419` →\n`_commands/__init__.py:160` and appear nowhere in the document. 75 is the one code a CI workflow\nactually branches on. Codes 3, 4, 12 and `validate`'s 0-4 severity bucket are also undocumented.\n\nThe doc's own scope note is stale: it says only five commands validate unknown options, but\n`metrics`, `doctor`, `composer` and `fsck` all exit 2 on unknown options today.\n\nA separate candidate finding — \"define an exit-code vocabulary and standardise usage\" — was run\nthrough the pipeline and FAILED both floors (impact 0.415). The one exit-code defect in this\nrepo's history (`show`/`list` returning 1 instead of 2) was caught by writing the doc and a\nconformance test, not by constants. That is the mitigation already in place, and this ticket\nextends it rather than replacing it. Do not add a named exit-code enum.\n\nFull generation was assessed and rejected: the command list is derivable, but per-command\n*semantics* have no machine-readable source, and exit 11 is produced at the CLI layer\n(`_cli/_llm_commands.py:129-171`), not in `_commands/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Rows exist for all 75 dispatcher arms\n- [ ] Codes 3, 4, 12, 75 and 78 are documented with their meanings\n- [ ] The stale \"only five commands validate options\" note is corrected\n- [ ] A CI check asserts every dispatcher arm has a row, so a new command without one fails\n- [ ] The document carries a forward-compatibility sentence: an unknown non-zero code MUST be treated as failure","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","47e9-728e-ba93-485e"],["depends_on","ae96-f114-5363-4d57"],["parent","b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181"],["relates_to","fcc0-3a8c-e88c-46d8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181","parent_status_uuid":"888432e3-fc32-4a3e-9b71-d9d68f1597d3","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["janitor"],"ticket_id":"f0ff-028a-f5cb-4b66","ticket_type":"task","title":"Make docs/exit-codes.md complete and keep it that way","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["57c85dd6-4e8f-4609-a94e-e816534c7a9b","134d1a41-20f9-481c-a449-1c828dc48af7","046773b0-7972-4eb6-a67e-92c9cd2bfe05","2cd585a8-1e99-48f4-9791-465128888546","888432e3-fc32-4a3e-9b71-d9d68f1597d3","1b9cb66f-2f97-4a26-bdbd-dcc14c82db56","066764f1-51b2-4296-8eb0-2c5c758b6e95"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786140165485766532,"uuid":"a91b4a5d-930c-43e5-81ed-4caa027924fd"}